},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Adults face muscle loss when aging, resulting in decrease in muscle strength, joint support, motor control. Thus people suffered from muscle loss may fall easily."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"CATALO FlexiJoint Muscle Collagen uses bioactive collagen BODYBALANCE, which is highly water soluble and thus can be absorbed easily.\r\nThis product is specially formulated with acerola cherry extract, providing natural vitamin C and assisting muscle growth."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"It is clinically proven to be effective in increasing muscle strength and improve motor control and thus improve quality of life.\r\nMain functions:\r\nIncrease muscle mass, slow down muscle loss\r\nImprove motor control\r\nImprove muscle strength, enhance joint protection\r\nSuitable for: weak joint, suffered from muscle loss, poor motor control, muscle feels tired easily, elderly"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"BODYBALANCE is a registered trademark of GELITA AG."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Serving directions\r\nFor normal dosage, take 3 scoops daily. For weaken muscle strength, take 3 level scoops twice daily. Mix with drinks or foods (e.g. juice, milk, soy milk, yoghurt, water) to serve. Take 3 months or more continuously for the best effect.\r\nPlease use the scoop attached for measurement."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Storage\r\nKeep in a dry and cool place.\r\nAvoid direct sunlight"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Current Good\r\ncGMP\r\nManufacturing Practices"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Made in USA"}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0065","langualCodeDescription":"Nutrient "},{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"},{"langualCode":"P0265","langualCodeDescription":"Structure/Function"}],"events":[{"date":"2023-12-14","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroup